longdesc associated with the counter specified to the command. These
longdesc commands are free-standing (i.e., don't need to be inside a
longdesc float environment). The package uses \DeclareCaption to define
longdesc \figcaption and \tabcaption, which can be used outside figure
longdesc or table environments.
