longdesc user) commands, as well package/class level commands. It is
longdesc fully implemented using expl3 syntax and structures, in
longdesc particular l3coffins, l3seq and l3keys. Besides those the
longdesc scontents and listing packages are used to typeset code
longdesc snippets.
