catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/easyfig
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics float graphics-use
catalogue-version 1.2a

name easyfloats
category Package
revision 57204
shortdesc An easier interface to insert figures, tables and other objects in LaTeX
relocated 1
longdesc In standard LaTeX inserting objects like figures or tables
longdesc requires too much knowledge for beginners and too much typing
longdesc effort and hardcoding for people like me. This package aims to
longdesc make insertion of figures and tables easier for both beginners
longdesc and experts. Despite the term floats in it's name it also
longdesc allows to disable floating of such objects.
