longdesc "mirrored". This is sometimes required by publishers who want
longdesc camera-ready documents to be printed on transparent film (to be
longdesc viewed from the "wrong" side). The package only works with
longdesc pdfLaTeX or LuaLaTeX in PDF output mode. Package everypage is
longdesc required on LaTeX releases before Fall 2020.
