shortdesc Gathering items from a list-like environment
relocated 1
longdesc This package provides a \gatheritems command to parse a list of
longdesc data separated by \item tokens. This makes it easier to define
longdesc custom environments which structure their data in the same way
longdesc that itemize or enumerate do.
