name l3experimental
category Package
revision 70026
shortdesc Experimental LaTeX3 concepts
relocated 1
longdesc The l3experimental packages are a collection of experimental
longdesc implementations for aspects of the LaTeX3 kernel, dealing with
longdesc higher-level ideas such as the Designer Interface. Some of them
longdesc work as stand alone packages, providing new functionality, and
longdesc can be used on top of LaTeX2e with no changes to the existing
longdesc kernel. The present release includes: l3benchmark for measuring
longdesc the time taken by TeX to run certain code; l3draw, a code-level
longdesc interface for constructing drawings; l3graphics, an interfaces
longdesc for the inclusion of graphics files; l3opacity, support for
longdesc opacity in PDF output; l3str, support for string manipulation;
longdesc l3sys-shell, which provides abstractions for common shell
longdesc functions like file deletion and copying; xcoffins, which
longdesc allows the alignment of boxes using a series of 'handle'
longdesc positions, supplementing the simple TeX reference point;
longdesc xgalley, which controls boxes receiving text for typesetting.
depend l3kernel
runfiles size=48
 RELOC/tex/latex/l3experimental/l3benchmark/l3benchmark.sty
 RELOC/tex/latex/l3experimental/l3draw/l3draw.sty
