name media4svg
category Package
revision 64686
shortdesc Multimedia inclusion for the dvisvgm backend
relocated 1
longdesc This package implements an interface for embedding video and
longdesc audio files in SVG (Scalable Vector Graphics) output. SVG with
longdesc embedded media is very portable, as it is supported by all
longdesc modern Web browsers across a variety of operating systems and
longdesc platforms, including portable devices. All DVI producing TeX
longdesc engines can be used. The dvisvgm utility, which is part of all
longdesc major TeX distributions, converts the intermediate DVI to SVG.
longdesc By default, media files are embedded into the SVG output to
longdesc make self-sufficient SVG files.
