name needspace
category Package
revision 29601
shortdesc Insert pagebreak if not enough space
relocated 1
longdesc Provides commands to disable pagebreaking within a given
longdesc vertical space. If there is not enough space between the
longdesc command and the bottom of the page, a new page will be started.
