relocated 1
longdesc pdfTeX and LuaTeX support several color stacks. This package
longdesc shows how a separate color stack can be used for transparency,
longdesc a property besides color that works across page breaks. If the
longdesc PDF management is used it can also be used with other engines,
longdesc but without support for page breaks.
