longdesc sheets or their revisions, - simple user friendly commands, -
longdesc elegant page formatting, - automatic numbering of exercises and
longdesc sub-exercises, - the number of the exercise sheet is extracted
longdesc automatically from the file name, - static information about
longdesc the lectures and the authors needs to provided at one point
longdesc only.
