relocated 1
longdesc This package identifies all widows and orphans in a document to
longdesc help a user to get rid of them. The act of resolving still
longdesc needs to be done manually: By rewriting text, running some
longdesc paragraph long or short or or explicitly breaking in some
longdesc strategic place. It will also identify and warn about words
longdesc broken across columns or pages and display formulas separated
longdesc from their introductory paragraph.
